IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`
IMPORT `P4-art-33-35`

-- Tests of Articles 33 to 35 (consolidated lines 584-598). Expected values are written from the text.
-- Each gated function: a case before (1 August 2025), on (2 August 2025) and after the date Chapter III Section 4 applies.

§ `Article 33(1), (2), (3)`

-- args: date asked, the body subcontracts or has recourse to a subsidiary, ensured the requirements of Article 31 are met, informed the notifying authority
#ASSERT `Art 33(1) the notified body has ensured the requirements are met and informed the notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(1) the notified body has ensured the requirements are met and informed the notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(1) the notified body has ensured the requirements are met and informed the notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(1) the notified body has ensured the requirements are met and informed the notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 33(1) the notified body has ensured the requirements are met and informed the notifying authority` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 33(1) the notified body has ensured the requirements are met and informed the notifying authority` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 33(1) the duty of the notified body to ensure that the subcontractor or the subsidiary meets the requirements` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 33 notified body` DOES `Art 33(1) ensure that the subcontractor or the subsidiary meets the requirements laid down in Article 31` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 33(1) the duty of the notified body to ensure that the subcontractor or the subsidiary meets the requirements` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 33(1) the duty of the notified body to inform the notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 33 notified body` DOES `Art 33(1) inform the notifying authority of the subcontracting or the recourse to a subsidiary` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 33(1) the duty of the notified body to inform the notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, takes full responsibility
#ASSERT `Art 33(2) the notified body takes full responsibility for the tasks performed by subcontractors and subsidiaries` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(2) the notified body takes full responsibility for the tasks performed by subcontractors and subsidiaries` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(2) the notified body takes full responsibility for the tasks performed by subcontractors and subsidiaries` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, the provider has agreed
#ASSERT `Art 33(3) first sentence the activities may be subcontracted or carried out by a subsidiary` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(3) first sentence the activities may be subcontracted or carried out by a subsidiary` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(3) first sentence the activities may be subcontracted or carried out by a subsidiary` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, the list of subsidiaries is publicly available
#ASSERT `Art 33(3) second sentence the notified body has made the list of its subsidiaries publicly available` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(3) second sentence the notified body has made the list of its subsidiaries publicly available` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(3) second sentence the notified body has made the list of its subsidiaries publicly available` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 33(3) the duty of the notified body to make a list of its subsidiaries publicly available` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 33 notified body` DOES `Art 33(3) make a list of its subsidiaries publicly available` AT 12
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 33(3) the duty of the notified body to make a list of its subsidiaries publicly available` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 33(4): the five years, on each side of the end of the period`

-- args: date asked, termination date of the subcontracting. Terminated on 31 December 2025: the five years end on 31 December 2030.
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 31 12 2030) (Date 31 12 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 1 1 2031) (Date 31 12 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 31 12 2025) (Date 31 12 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 30 12 2025) (Date 31 12 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Terminated on 29 February 2028: five years on has no 29 February, so the period ends on 28 February 2033 (fork F-months).
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 28 2 2033) (Date 29 2 2028) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 1 3 2033) (Date 29 2 2028) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Before the group applies (2 August 2025), even for a subcontracting that ended on 1 August 2025.
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the five years from the termination date of the subcontracting are running` (Date 1 8 2025) (Date 1 8 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, termination date, the documents are kept at the disposal of the notifying authority
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the notified body has kept the documents at the disposal of the notifying authority` (Date 31 12 2030) (Date 31 12 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the notified body has kept the documents at the disposal of the notifying authority` (Date 31 12 2030) (Date 31 12 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the notified body has kept the documents at the disposal of the notifying authority` (Date 1 1 2031) (Date 31 12 2025) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the notified body has kept the documents at the disposal of the notifying authority` (Date 30 12 2025) (Date 31 12 2025) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 33(4) the notified body has kept the documents at the disposal of the notifying authority` (Date 1 8 2025) (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 34`

-- args: date asked, the body has verified the conformity of the high-risk AI system under Article 43
#ASSERT `Art 34(1) the notified body has verified the conformity of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 34(1) the notified body has verified the conformity of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(1) the notified body has verified the conformity of the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 34(1) the duty of the notified body to verify the conformity of high-risk AI systems` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 34 notified body` DOES `Art 34(1) verify the conformity of high-risk AI systems in accordance with the conformity assessment procedures set out in Article 43` AT 40
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 34(1) the duty of the notified body to verify the conformity of high-risk AI systems` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, avoids unnecessary burdens, due account of size, of sector, of structure, of complexity, the provider is a micro or small enterprise, minimised burdens and costs for it
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) first sentence the notified body has avoided unnecessary burdens and taken due account of the provider and the system` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, respects the degree of rigour and the level of protection required
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) second sentence the notified body has respected the degree of rigour and the level of protection required` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) second sentence the notified body has respected the degree of rigour and the level of protection required` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(2) second sentence the notified body has respected the degree of rigour and the level of protection required` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, the notifying authority has requested the documentation, the body has made available and submitted it
#ASSERT `Art 34(3) the notified body has submitted the documentation upon request` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 34(3) the notified body has submitted the documentation upon request` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 34(3) the notified body has submitted the documentation upon request` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 34(3) the notified body has submitted the documentation upon request` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 34(3) the duty of the notified body to make available and submit the documentation upon request` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 34 notified body` DOES `Art 34(3) make available and submit upon request all relevant documentation to the notifying authority` AT 7
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 34(3) the duty of the notified body to make available and submit the documentation upon request` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

§ `Article 35`

-- args: date asked, the number of identification numbers assigned to the body (a body notified under more than one Union act must still have one)
#ASSERT `Art 35(1) the Commission has assigned a single identification number to the notified body` (Date 2 8 2025) 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 35(1) the Commission has assigned a single identification number to the notified body` (Date 2 8 2025) 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 35(1) the Commission has assigned a single identification number to the notified body` (Date 2 8 2025) 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 35(1) the Commission has assigned a single identification number to the notified body` (Date 1 8 2025) 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 35(1) the duty of the Commission to assign a single identification number` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 35 Commission` DOES `Art 35(1) assign a single identification number to each notified body` AT 9
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 35(1) the duty of the Commission to assign a single identification number` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- args: date asked, list made publicly available, includes identification numbers, includes the activities, kept up to date
#ASSERT `Art 35(2) the Commission has made the list publicly available and kept it up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 35(2) the Commission has made the list publicly available and kept it up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 35(2) the Commission has made the list publicly available and kept it up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 35(2) the Commission has made the list publicly available and kept it up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 35(2) the Commission has made the list publicly available and kept it up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 35(2) the Commission has made the list publicly available and kept it up to date` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 35(2) the duty of the Commission to make the list publicly available` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 35 Commission` DOES `Art 35(2) make publicly available the list of the bodies notified under this Regulation` AT 3
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 35(2) the duty of the Commission to make the list publicly available` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 35(2) the duty of the Commission to keep the list up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 35 Commission` DOES `Art 35(2) keep the list up to date` AT 3
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 35(2) the duty of the Commission to keep the list up to date` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
